  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The distance between the given parallel lines <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/48eac254-6043-47e5-b3dd-3ebb84060d58.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.56667in;height:1.32014in\" /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Length of the side of the triangle is <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence, the area of triangle <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units",
    "image": null
  },
